{"ref":"BDB, כֹּ֫בֶד","hw":"כֹּ֫בֶד","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">כֹּ֫בֶד</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>]<br><strong>1.</strong>  <strong> heaviness</strong>, <em>weight</em> of a stone <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 27:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.27.3\">Pr 27:3</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>mass, abundance</em>, of corpses <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:3\" href=\"/Nahum.3.3\">Na 3:3</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>vehemence</em>, of war <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 21:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.21.15\">Is 21:15</a>, of storm <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:27\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.27\">Is 30:27</a>.","next":"BDB, כָּבוֹד","prev":"BDB, כָּבֵד³"}